    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNVEIL A NEW LAND TO BELONG</strong><br>In a dystopian post-war world marked by harsh living conditions and limited resources, play as Niuma, a young woman born with albinism.<br>Your goal is to reach the promised land with the help of your makeshift truck.<br>Explore cities with unique customs and interact with locals. Navigate through a decaying environment populated by memorable characters, on foot and by truck.<br>Manage your resources and overcome obstacles while dealing with stigmatization in a world where oppression and tragedy are often juxtaposed against compassion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a9b25b42ec3cde0a8f797f2283fc618a.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Embark on a journey to uncover the mysterious El Dorado as you navigate the roads and cities.<br>Explore unique cities, each with its own culture and stories.<br>Survive the roads by making strategic decisions and managing your resources while avoiding danger and hazards.<br>Learn about the customs and history of the places you traverse by listening to the tales of Griots and their traditional instrument.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/354ffc7e907c2a6734dadb84a0548b38.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Through a unique interactive dialogue system, influence how locals perceive you and<br>overcome stigmatization by using clothing items and interaction skills to gain acceptance or avoid rejection, thus accessing new resources and information for your next trip. Carefully weigh the decision of whether or not to conceal your stigma in a world where you will constantly face difficult moral dilemmas, as hiding yourself can negatively impact your mental health and potentially end your journey prematurely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/8c191f506dca13c077d759fc7b712a93.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Collect resources, such as gas, modules, and equipment, by dismantling and hacking old war machines to upgrade your truck and equipment, thereby increasing your chances of survival.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Blind Frontiers, each city has its own unique story to tell. The game immerses you in an emotional and rich narrative with a strong emphasis on social impact, where your choices shape the outcome of the story. It presents characters who are more complex than they initially appear, intimately blending cruelty and altruism, horror and beauty, selfishness and generosity...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/dc06a49d7f224a8f68162c66bb4a559b.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/dc06a49d7f224a8f68162c66bb4a559b.webp?t=1689079371\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/9b0763043f42c725350fd3b40e2154f3.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UNVEIL A NEW LAND TO BELONG</strong><br>In a dystopian post-war world marked by harsh living conditions and limited resources, play as Niuma, a young woman born with albinism.<br>Your goal is to reach the promised land with the help of your makeshift truck.<br>Explore cities with unique customs and interact with locals. Navigate through a decaying environment populated by memorable characters, on foot and by truck.<br>Manage your resources and overcome obstacles while dealing with stigmatization in a world where oppression and tragedy are often juxtaposed against compassion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a9b25b42ec3cde0a8f797f2283fc618a.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Embark on a journey to uncover the mysterious El Dorado as you navigate the roads and cities.<br>Explore unique cities, each with its own culture and stories.<br>Survive the roads by making strategic decisions and managing your resources while avoiding danger and hazards.<br>Learn about the customs and history of the places you traverse by listening to the tales of Griots and their traditional instrument.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/a36c3cbe639180cff42323a6ecedba0b.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/354ffc7e907c2a6734dadb84a0548b38.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Through a unique interactive dialogue system, influence how locals perceive you and<br>overcome stigmatization by using clothing items and interaction skills to gain acceptance or avoid rejection, thus accessing new resources and information for your next trip. Carefully weigh the decision of whether or not to conceal your stigma in a world where you will constantly face difficult moral dilemmas, as hiding yourself can negatively impact your mental health and potentially end your journey prematurely.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/54112e6b837d9355ebfe02d91c6e1d97.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/8c191f506dca13c077d759fc7b712a93.avif?t=1689079371\" /></span><br>Collect resources, such as gas, modules, and equipment, by dismantling and hacking old war machines to upgrade your truck and equipment, thereby increasing your chances of survival.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.webm?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/ebd9ee06c70362a93c9f72814ab7bf64.mp4?t=1689079371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Blind Frontiers, each city has its own unique story to tell. The game immerses you in an emotional and rich narrative with a strong emphasis on social impact, where your choices shape the outcome of the story. It presents characters who are more complex than they initially appear, intimately blending cruelty and altruism, horror and beauty, selfishness and generosity...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/dc06a49d7f224a8f68162c66bb4a559b.poster.avif?t=1689079371\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275340/extras/dc06a49d7f224a8f68162c66bb4a559b.webp?t=1689079371\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
